ing confirmed arithmetically: factor = total CO2 / total net generation incl. RE.", "FY2024-25: 1234.19 Mt / 1739.06 BU = 0.7097 -> 0.710; FY2023-24: 1203.36/1654.54 = 0.7273 -> 0.727; FY2022-23: 1108.11/1547.80 = 0.7159 -> 0.716; FY2013-14: 727.4/939.83 = 0.774.", "Internal inconsistency inside the NITI report: the summary table (p.~10) lists ''Grid Emission Factor 0.727'' for the current year, which is the FY2023-24 value; Section 4.4.6 and Annexure E give 0.71 for 2025 (FY2024-25)."]}, "retrieved": "2026-10-17"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (source_id) DO NOTHING;
